    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A collection of mini-game variants, mainly casual games that rely on clicking and simple operations. Currently playable mini-games:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tetris: Classic game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >fastClick:Randomly lit small squares will appear on the screen, tap them quickly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >forward, :Move forward, shoot enemies, and continuously gain buffs or debuffs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reaction:Stand in the center of the screen, face incoming enemies or fruits, eat or dodge depends on your reaction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >catchButton:The button keeps flying towards the center of the screen, catch it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snake:Move up, down, left or right to eat food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >openFruits:Flip over two identical fruits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump:Stand on the spring, charge with right mouse button, jump left or right, pay attention to mouse position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >jigsaw:Complete the beautiful picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >slidingPicture:Complete the beautiful picture. </p>",
